title: metarecord-list:toggle
tags: [[GUI command]] Metarecord
kind: reference
summary: Metarecord list: toggle a view flag (freeze / mode)

`metarecord-list:toggle freeze` checks or unchecks ''Freeze'' on the normal DSL field of the [[metarecord-list panel]], exactly as a click on the box would, and leaves the focus where it is. (`metarecord-list:focus normal` freezes too, but moves the focus there; `metarecord-list:focus simplified` unfreezes.)
